{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/About_The_Game_Banner.png?t=1751457656\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the quirky town of Larcenest Gap. Take pictures with your camera and write articles in your journal. Interact with the people who have daily routines and help them with their various tasks. Use your investigating skills to unravel the mystery surrounding this town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camera</strong> - Take pictures of everything you like and of what the townspeople ask you.  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/Picture_Taking_GIF.gif?t=1751457656\" /></div><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Journal</strong> - Full freedom to write whatever you like and customize your journal into something personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/1aaaca1ebb57a6c2b242fb98dfaefa15.poster.webp?t=1751457656\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/1aaaca1ebb57a6c2b242fb98dfaefa15.webp?t=1751457656\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day and night cycle</strong> - Experience a different environment at night as you see the people and other creatures go about their daily routines.    <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/DaynNight.gif?t=1751457656\" /></div>Collect - Find interesting things and photograph them, and be rewarded with new stickers for your journal!    </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664070?t=1751457656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/3bec93f1807bcc22c53f1fc2b2f45fe191ad4c29/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751457656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/c803692b3a6a765ea4d4aa8a916f2269ad256dbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751457656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/c803692b3a6a765ea4d4aa8a916f2269ad256dbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751457656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/About_The_Game_Banner.png?t=1751457656\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the quirky town of Larcenest Gap. Take pictures with your camera and write articles in your journal. Interact with the people who have daily routines and help them with their various tasks. Use your investigating skills to unravel the mystery surrounding this town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camera</strong> - Take pictures of everything you like and of what the townspeople ask you.  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/Picture_Taking_GIF.gif?t=1751457656\" /></div><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Journal</strong> - Full freedom to write whatever you like and customize your journal into something personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"b